  DialogueLines:
  - well i'll be scrapped!
  - 'you made it back alive! '
  - 'and you managed to find my arm! '
  - 'I suppose that I was wrong to doubt you after you saved us earlier. '
  - 'it''s just that... Bots like you aren''t usually so down to earth '
